        "de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "100-Day Money-Back Guarantee",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>We truly believe FreshWipes will make a difference – for both you and your dog.<br/><br/>That’s why we offer a <strong>100-day money-backguarantee</strong>.</p><p>You can try the product at home, in your own time.<br/><br/>Not completely satisfied? Then you’ll get your money back – no stress, no hassle.</p><p>For us, it’s more important that your dog gets the care they deserve than that you keep something you don’t love.</p><p><strong>You can read more about our satisfaction guarantee here.<br/></strong><a href=\"/pages/100-dagers-fornoydgaranti\" title=\"100-Day Satisfaction Guarantee\">100-Day Satisfaction Guarantee</a></p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_dXPxNb": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What to expect?",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "icon": "dentistry",
            "filled_icon": true,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Daily use helps prevent plaque, tear stains, and ear wax buildup before they become bigger problems. Here's what you'll typically notice in your dog:</p><p><strong>Week 1 </strong>— Breath smells fresher, eyes look cleaner with less daily buildup, and ears stay fresher between cleanings.</p><p><strong>Week 2</strong>— Teeth appear cleaner as plaque and surface staining begin to lift, tear stains become less noticeable, and ear wax is easier to manage.</p><p><strong>Week 3</strong>— Cleaner teeth, brighter eyes, healthier ears, and a simple routine that keeps new buildup from returning.</p><p>Every wipe lifts away the buildup you can actually see—from plaque on teeth to debris around the eyes and ears—giving you visible proof that you're removing it, not just spreading it around.</p>",
            "page": "free-e-book-the-secret-to-a-sparkling-home-in-just-15-minutes-a-day",
            "margin_top": 12,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_EGhYxC": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why RoutineCare?",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "icon": "loyalty",
            "filled_icon": true,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>✓ Save 20% on every order</p><p>✓ Free shipping, always</p><p>✓ Free gifts — plus surprise treats in your boxes</p><p>✓ Delivered every 30 days — skip, reschedule or change frequency anytime</p><p>✓ Skip, pause or cancel anytime — you're always in control</p><p>✓ Your refill arrives before you run out</p><p>✓ Consistency is what makes results last</p><p>✓ 100-day money-back guarantee — or you don't pay</p>",
            "page": "free-e-book-the-secret-to-a-sparkling-home-in-just-15-minutes-a-day",
            "margin_top": 12,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Ggawti": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "icon": "nutrition",
            "filled_icon": true,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<h4><strong>FreshWipes Ingredients</strong></h4><p>EDI purified water – base solution<br/><br/>• Glycerin – moisturizes<br/><br/>• Citric acid – balances pH<br/><br/>• Sodium benzoate – gently preserves<br/><br/>• Cetylpyridinium chloride – antibacterial effect<br/><br/>• Tea polyphenols – fresh breath<br/><br/>• Allantoin – soothing<br/><br/>• Green tea extract – naturally antibacterial & protective</p><h4>Eyewipes <strong>Ingredients</strong></h4><p><strong>EDI-purified water</strong>– base solution<br/><br/><strong>Aloe Vera (Aloe Barbadensis)</strong>– soothes and moisturizes the skin around the eyes<br/><br/><strong>Chamomile (Chamomilla Recutita)</strong>– known for its mild, anti-inflammatory properties<br/><br/><strong>Glycerin</strong>– binds moisture and protects the skin<br/><br/><strong>Ethylhexylglycerin</strong>– gentle preservation and antibacterial effect<br/><br/><strong>Decyl Glucoside</strong>– mild cleansing surfactant from plants<br/><br/><strong>Polyhexamethylene Biguanide Hydrochloride</strong>– antibacterial, counteracts irritation<br/></p><h4>Earwipes ingredienser</h4><p><strong>N-(3-aminopropyl)-N-dodecyl-1 </strong>- gently cleans and helps dissolve dirt and wax</p><p><br/><strong>Benzalkonium chloride</strong> – antibacterial ingredient that fights bacteria and contributes to healthy ears</p><p><br/><strong>Iodopropynyl butylcarbamate</strong> – mild preservative component that keeps the wipes hygienic<br/><br/><strong>Corn extract</strong> – naturally emollient and nourishing for sensitive skin<br/><br/><strong>Ethylene Glycol Mono Phenyl Ether</strong> – helps to gently dissolve grease and impurities<br/><br/><strong>Rosemary extract </strong>– naturally cleansing and refreshing, with calming properties<br/><br/><strong>Witch Hazel extrac</strong>t – soothes the skin and reduces irritation<br/><br/><strong>Fragrance </strong>– provides a mild, fresh feeling<br/><br/><strong>Water (Aqua)</strong> – basic solution</p><p><br/><strong>Vitamin </strong>E – strengthens and protects sensitive skin</p><h4>All products are:</h4><p>✔️ pH-balanced & fragrance-free<br/><br/>✔️ Cruelty-free<br/><br/>✔️ Free from alcohol, fluoride & harsh chemicals</p>",
            "page": "free-e-book-the-secret-to-a-sparkling-home-in-just-15-minutes-a-day",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_aFAiwA": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Payment & Delivery",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "icon": "delivery_truck_speed",
            "filled_icon": true,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<h4><strong>Payment</strong></h4><p>You can safely pay with Klarna, credit card, or bank transfer – choose what works best for you.<br/></p><h4><strong>Shipping</strong></h4><p><br/>We offer different rates for the UK and the Rest of the World:</p><ul><li><strong>United Kingdom (UK): </strong>Standard Shipping: <strong>£2.00</strong> (Free on orders £37 and over)Priority Shipping: <strong>£4.50</strong></li><li><strong>Rest of the World:</strong>Standard Shipping: <strong>$2.95</strong> (Free on orders $49 and over)Priority Shipping: <strong>$6.00</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Delivery Time</strong><br/><br/>As our UK warehouse is temporarily out of stock, your order will be shipped from our international warehouse.<br/>We offer two shipping options at checkout:</p><ul><li><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> 1–2 days handling + 5–10 days shipping time</li><li><strong>Priority Shipping:</strong> 1–2 days handling + 4–7 days shipping time</li></ul><p>A tracking number will be sent by email as soon as your order leaves the warehouse.</p><p><strong>Questions?</strong><br/>Email us at <strong>info@shopvetpets.com</strong> – we always reply within 24 hours on weekdays.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
