    "testimonials_F8qReC": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "column_6yQq3a": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Highly recommend!",
            "text": "<p>I was skeptical at first - how many products have I bought that would solve everything? But this kit has really made a difference. Bella usually runs away as soon as she sees the toothbrush, but with these wipes she actually sits still. It takes less than two minutes and I really notice that her breath is better. I use the ear wipes a couple of times a week and save expensive vet visits. Highly recommended</p>",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild1_b3680c3c-3c9b-4f7c-aaa0-1c5e71863e67.webp",
            "author": "Erik A"
          }
        },
        "column_pUHnPD": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Always had problems until now",
            "text": "<p>I've had Max for 8 years and he's always had problems with his ears. Been to the vet at least four times for ear infections and each time it costs thousands of kronor. Started using EarWipes three months ago and he hasn't had a single problem since. Bought the whole kit now on Black Friday because it was cheaper than buying separately. Good composition of ingredients, nothing strange. Exactly what I was looking for.</p>",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild1_78735bd1-dd93-45c0-b80c-27246ca5802d.webp",
            "author": "Johan E"
          }
        },
        "column_eLJGcQ": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Highly recommend these to all dog owners",
            "text": "<p>Works exactly as it should. I have two Labradors and before there was always something - red eyes, bad breath, ear odor. Now I take two minutes every evening after a walk and wipe them off thoroughly with these wipes. They seem to think it's nice actually. I've had the kit for six weeks now and I see a clear improvement in Ludde's teeth, they are starting to get whiter. Affordable when you consider what the vet would cost.</p>",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_577888762156024773-85af7afa-6b6e-4643-86dc-336cf7ca13d9.webp",
            "author": "Sara Johansson"
          }
        }
      },
