          "settings": {
            "heading": "How often should I use the FreshCare Kit?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Daily use provides the best results. 2 minutes a day is enough to prevent plaque, wax and irritation. You can use all three wipes at the same time or rotate depending on your needs.</p>",
